# Instance with FD coverage violation
# A determined TypeVar must appear in the determining positions.
# Here c@z has TypeVar "z" which does not appear in positions a or b.
[
  # Define a class with FD: (a, b) determines c
  TestAdd: [class [let a b c] [determines: [[[a b] c]]]
    op: [Fn@c [a b]]]

  # Coverage violation: c@z uses TypeVar "z" which is absent from (a, b) positions
  TestAddInst: [instance TestAdd
    [pattern [a@x b@y c@z]]: op: [fn [let p q] p]]

  result: 42
]

---

%.result
=== out
[CoverageViolation] coverage violation
